  - `GET /api/etl-trigger/status`: Service status with `dryRun`, `rerunPoolSize`, and loaded pipeline count.
- **[DashboardController.java](file:///c:/Users/fg8n8x/Desktop/wip/exensioreload/backend/src/main/java/com/onsemi/cim/apps/exensio/exensioreload/controller/DashboardController.java)**:
  - `GET /api/dashboard/pipelines`: Provides the UI with active pipeline definitions and stage metadata.

